  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></math> are the roots<br /><math><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> The roots are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2,3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mr